# ---- local-only, never in the repo -------------------------------------
# A virtualenv (1.0GB) and a browser profile are not source. tiktok_sessions/
# in particular is a live Chrome profile: it holds logged-in session cookies,
# so committing it would publish working credentials to GitHub. These are
# listed rather than deleted — they are working state on the machine.
